1
00:00:43,649 --> 00:00:51,537
I creep out of the oak and stone,
To claim your body as my own.

2
00:00:51,578 --> 00:00:59,267
I lock your chest in icy bands,
And force your trembling, helpless hands.

3
00:00:59,330 --> 00:01:06,978
Play on, play on, you broken fool!
You are my small and helpless tool!

4
00:01:06,988 --> 00:01:15,912
You kill Luna with each note you play,
And throw your bleeding soul away!

5
00:01:31,586 --> 00:01:39,504
The air you breathe is black as tar,
You cannot run, you won't get far.

6
00:01:39,712 --> 00:01:47,273
These pipes become a monster's jaw,
To crush you in its heavy claw.

7
00:01:47,296 --> 00:01:54,956
Play on, play on, you broken fool!
You are my small and helpless tool!

8
00:01:54,978 --> 00:02:04,132
You kill Luna with each note you play,
And throw your bleeding soul away!

9
00:02:11,503 --> 00:02:19,579
Your Lion cries: "The pieces fit!"
I tear his throat and laugh at it!

10
00:02:19,639 --> 00:02:27,453
Your matching pieces crash and fall,
And shatter against every wall!

11
00:02:27,489 --> 00:02:34,646
Play on, play on, you broken fool!
You are my small and helpless tool!

12
00:02:34,757 --> 00:02:43,881
You kill Luna with each note you play,
And throw your bleeding soul away!

13
00:02:51,594 --> 00:02:59,379
I drive my knee into your spine,
Your trembling heart is now all mine.

14
00:02:59,573 --> 00:03:07,208
Ram rusty nails into the wood,
And prove your love was never good!

15
00:03:07,252 --> 00:03:14,908
Play on, play on, you broken fool!
You are my small and helpless tool!

16
00:03:14,919 --> 00:03:24,301
You kill Luna with each note you play,
And throw your bleeding soul away!

17
00:03:55,578 --> 00:04:03,292
Your vision turns to black and dread,
The choir roars inside your head!

18
00:04:03,516 --> 00:04:11,717
A screaming wall of flesh and fire,
That burns you on a hopeless pyre!

19
00:04:11,739 --> 00:04:19,461
The chord stops short, the church turns cold,
A sacred silence to behold.

20
00:04:19,671 --> 00:04:28,466
A single hot tear burns your face,
Lost in this dark and holy place.

21
00:04:35,521 --> 00:04:43,260
You pack your bag with shaking hands,
No singer there can understand.

22
00:04:43,586 --> 00:04:56,472
You walk down from the organ space,
Broken, trembling, from this holy place.

